{"schema_version":1,"key":"dish-3a181639cf91","reference_recipes":[{"id":"howtocook-3a181639cf91","name":"牛油果拉西","category":"drink","url":"https://github.com/Anduin2017/HowToCook/blob/0e106eea348c734fe1586f781202994439cf98a5/dishes/drink/%E7%89%9B%E6%B2%B9%E6%9E%9C%E6%8B%89%E8%A5%BF.md","blob_sha":"97885471f40662f947482fa8d02989def75c919e","details":{"introduction":"这是一款融合了印度传统酸奶饮品“拉西”的创新饮品，口感绵密顺滑、清甜不腻，特别适合作为早餐或午后提神饮品。牛油果富含单不饱和脂肪酸与膳食纤维，搭配酸奶的优质蛋白和益生菌，一杯便能提供持久饱腹感。制作极为简单，新手也能零失败，从备料到享用只需 大约 5 分钟。","difficulty":"★","sections":[{"heading":"必备原料和工具","markdown":"- 原味酸奶 (Plain yogurt)\n- 熟透的牛油果\n- 蜂蜜\n- 冷牛奶\n- 小豆蔻粉（可选）\n- 薄荷叶或坚果碎（可选，用于装饰）\n- 搅拌机（破壁机/榨汁机）"},{"heading":"计算","markdown":"每次制作前需要确定计划做几份。一份正好够 1 个人饮用。\n\n每份：\n\n- 原味酸奶 120 ml\n- 熟透的牛油果 1 个\n- 蜂蜜 1 汤匙（可根据口味增减）\n- 冷牛奶 60 ml\n- 小豆蔻粉 1 撮（可选）"},{"heading":"操作","markdown":"1. 将牛油果对半切开，去核，剥去外皮，将果肉切成小块备用。\n2. 在搅拌机中加入 120ml 原味酸奶、切好的牛油果块、1 汤匙蜂蜜以及 60ml 冷牛奶。\n3. （可选）加入一小撮小豆蔻粉以增加独特风味。\n4. 启动搅拌机，**搅拌大约 1 分钟**直至液体变得完全顺滑和浓郁。\n5. 将打好的饮品倒入杯中。\n6. （可选）在表面放上几片薄荷叶或撒上 5g 切碎的坚果作为装饰。"},{"heading":"附加内容","markdown":"- 牛油果必须选择熟透的，这样才能保证饮品的绵密口感和颜色。\n- 如果喜欢更冰凉的口感，可以适当减少一点牛奶，加入几块冰块一起搅拌。"}]}}],"nutrition":{"status":"reference","basis":"per_100g","serving_g":null,"scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：牛油果果肉200g、原味全脂酸奶300g、3.25%全脂牛奶100g；整份约600g。无蜂蜜标准变体，全脂原味酸奶和牛奶，无糖。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","per_100g":{"energy_kcal":94,"protein_g":2.926667,"carbohydrate_g":5.97,"fat_g":7.07},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171705/nutrients","version":"bafa52d279d998c7","fdc_ids":[171705,171284,172217]},"profile_id":"family-3a181639cf91-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-3a181639cf91","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","is_estimate":true,"match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-3a181639cf91","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"cold_mix","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":false,"sugar_added":false,"sauce_added":false,"brand":null,"variant":"family-3a181639cf91-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"avocado","grams":200},{"key":"yogurt","grams":300},{"key":"milk","grams":100}],"excludes":["不同主料、品种、品牌、用量、含水量或额外配料","带骨带壳毛重、丢弃汤汁或锅中残油的实际摄入计算","将家庭份成品重量假设当作实测或USDA出成率"]},"data_version":"bafa52d279d998c7","completeness":"complete","rules_version":"nutrition-1.6.0","details":{"path":"assets/nutrition/family-3a181639cf91-v1.daf2c295f73d1c1c.json","bytes":16882,"sha256":"daf2c295f73d1c1c6a569657ecd06126a7cc5bc580c050a232aee0238c423a11"},"requires_independent_match":true},"nutrition_profiles":[{"id":"family-3a181639cf91-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-3a181639cf91","recipe_blob_sha":"97885471f40662f947482fa8d02989def75c919e","version":"1","data_version":"bafa52d279d998c7","status":"reference","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","basis":"per_100g","completeness":"complete","scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：牛油果果肉200g、原味全脂酸奶300g、3.25%全脂牛奶100g；整份约600g。无蜂蜜标准变体，全脂原味酸奶和牛奶，无糖。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-3a181639cf91","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"cold_mix","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":false,"sugar_added":false,"sauce_added":false,"brand":null,"variant":"family-3a181639cf91-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"avocado","grams":200},{"key":"yogurt","grams":300},{"key":"milk","grams":100}],"excludes":["不同主料、品种、品牌、用量、含水量或额外配料","带骨带壳毛重、丢弃汤汁或锅中残油的实际摄入计算","将家庭份成品重量假设当作实测或USDA出成率"]},"per_100g":{"energy_kcal":94,"protein_g":2.926667,"carbohydrate_g":5.97,"fat_g":7.07},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171705/nutrients","version":"bafa52d279d998c7","fdc_ids":[171705,171284,172217]},"rules_version":"nutrition-1.6.0","is_estimate":true,"requires_independent_match":true,"details":{"path":"assets/nutrition/family-3a181639cf91-v1.daf2c295f73d1c1c.json","bytes":1688